# The single source of truth for which OpenPGP implementation this app links.
#
# Read by .github/workflows/gopenpgp-xcframework.yml (which builds it) and by
# gopenpgp-upstream-watch.yml (which notices when upstream moves). Changing
# GOPENPGP_VERSION here is what triggers a rebuild — nothing auto-bumps it,
# because a crypto implementation should not change under a mail client
# without someone deciding to.
GOPENPGP_VERSION=v3.5.1

# The package list, build tags and gomobile invocation are NOT duplicated here.
# The build runs upstream's own `build.sh apple`, which binds six packages
# (crypto, armor, constants, mime, mobile, profile) with `-tags mobile,ios`.
# Restating any of that here would be a second copy free to drift from theirs.

# Filled in by the build workflow's release step; the app pins this.
# GOPENPGP_XCFRAMEWORK_SHA256=
